{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114961","id":3814756371,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc69PPo_","number":114961,"title":"Fix DirectionalLight3D soft shadows large coordinate imprecision","user":{"login":"Robert-K","id":34353377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MzUzMzc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34353377?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K","html_url":"https://github.com/Robert-K","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-14T20:27:51Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T19:53:23Z","closed_at":"2026-06-30T19:53:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114961","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114961.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114961.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #86536 and possibly #63610.\r\n\r\nDirectional light soft shadow penumbras depend on the distance between shadow caster and shadow receiver.\r\nThis distance was previously calculated using world space coordinates, which led to imprecise results further from the origin.\r\nThis PR changes that calculation to be based on coordinates relative to the camera position.\r\n\r\nThe picture on the left shows the shadow near the origin, the right one show it at ~320 units away from 0. It gets worse the further you go.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1097\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9627f051-e954-4ed4-869e-ff45ed0c1f0f\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1146\" height=\"642\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f79bcdc5-8f26-4218-a3ea-0c6a7257da48\" />\r\n\r\n([Captured using this issue's MRP](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86536))\r\n\r\nHigher shadow cascades (further from camera) still show some artifacts:\r\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/098108ac-b60d-4151-9c26-739057f88ffa\" />\r\nNot yet quite sure what's causing these.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114961/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}